# RUN(CALLS): valueflow-solve calls
# CALLS: f3 v1 -> f2
# RUN(RESULTS): valueflow-results
# RESULTS: function f0 {{*}}executions=AtMostOnce
# RESULTS: function f1 {{*}}executions=AtMostOnce

